# Boolean fit checks (gate.sh): the clamped pose - body + both arms latched -
# MINUS the enclosure envelope (glass + frame lip + seam bead) must render
# EMPTY: nothing bears inside the glass, the lip or the bead zone.
clamped     empty
# Negative control: grip_gap forced 1 mm past crushing - the arm bearing face
# lands inside the lip and the check MUST fire (else "empty" proves nothing).
clamped_neg interferes
